---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Breadcrumbs from '../components/Breadcrumbs.astro';
import { SITE, HAS_PHONE, HAS_EMAIL } from '../config';
const updated = 'August 2026';
---
<BaseLayout title={`Privacy Policy | ${SITE.brand}`} description="How Tree Service Hickory NC collects, uses and shares the information you give us." breadcrumb="Privacy Policy">
  <section>
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px">
      <Breadcrumbs label="Privacy Policy" />
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p><em>Last updated {updated}.</em></p>

      <p>This policy covers
      {SITE.domain} and explains what we collect, why, and who else may see it.</p>

      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>Only what you type into a form or tell us on the phone: your name, email address,
      phone number, the property address if you give it, and whatever you write about your
      project.</p>
      <p>Our website host also records standard technical information, which covers the page you visited,
      roughly where in the world the request came from, and the type of device. We use analytics
      to see which pages people find useful. Calls placed from this site may be routed through a
      call-tracking service that records the number you called from and, where the law allows,
      the call itself.</p>

      <h2>Why we collect it</h2>
      <p>To answer your inquiry, quote your project, arrange a site visit, and do the work if
      you hire us. We keep inquiry records so we can pick up a conversation you started months
      earlier, because a repair is often planned a while before it is booked.</p>

      <h2>⚠️ Sharing your inquiry with other companies</h2>
      <p><strong>Read this part.</strong> We do not take on every job that comes to us. Some projects are outside
      what we do, outside the area we cover, or better suited to another contractor.</p>
      <p><strong>When that happens, we may pass your inquiry, meaning your name, your contact
      details and what you told us about the project, to another company we believe can help.</strong> We do
      this so you get an answer rather than silence, and we may receive a referral fee when we do.</p>
      <p>If you would rather we did not, say so in your message or reply to any email from us and
      we will keep your details to ourselves. You can also ask us at any time who, if anyone, we
      passed your inquiry to.</p>

      <h2>Who else sees your information</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Service providers who run things on our behalf, including website hosting, email delivery,
        call tracking, analytics, and any scheduling or invoicing software we use.</li>
        <li>Subcontractors and suppliers, where the work requires it. For example, a supplier
        needs a delivery address, and a trade needs to know where the job is.</li>
        <li>Another contractor, in the referral case described above.</li>
        <li>Anyone we are legally required to give it to.</li>
      </ul>
      <p><strong>We do not sell your information</strong>, and we do not hand your details to
      advertisers or list brokers.</p>

      <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
      <p>Inquiries that do not turn into work: a few years, so we recognise you if you come back.
      Records of jobs we did: as long as we are required to keep business and tax records. Ask us
      to delete your details and we will, unless the law requires us to keep them.</p>

      <h2>Cookies</h2>
      <p>Cookies are used on this site for analytics and, if you called or submitted a form, for call
      tracking. You can block cookies in your browser settings, and the site will still work.</p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>You can ask us what we hold about you, ask us to correct it, ask us to delete it, or ask
      us to stop contacting you. {HAS_EMAIL
        ? <>Email <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a></>
        : <>Use our <a href="/contact/">contact form</a></>} and we
      will deal with your request promptly.</p>

      <h2>Children</h2>
      <p>Nothing on this site is aimed at children, and we do not knowingly collect information
      from anyone under 13.</p>

      <h2>Changes</h2>
      <p>If this policy changes we will update the date at the top.</p>

      <h2>Text message (SMS) service</h2>
      <p>{SITE.brand} sends text message updates and responses to customers about pricing
      and products offered at {SITE.domain}.</p>
      <p>Mobile information will not be shared with third parties or affiliates for marketing or
      promotional purposes. {SITE.brand} respects your privacy. We use information you
      provide to send and respond to your mobile messages. This includes sharing it with platform
      providers, phone companies, and other vendors who help us deliver messages. We won't share
      mobile information with third parties for marketing purposes. Text messaging originator
      opt-in data and consent are exempt from this. We may disclose information to satisfy legal,
      regulatory, or governmental requests, avoid liability, or protect our rights or property.
      This policy applies to your use of the Text Message Service and doesn't modify our general
      Privacy Policy, which may govern our relationship with you in other contexts.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>{SITE.brand}<br />
      {SITE.brand}<br />
      {HAS_EMAIL && <><a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a><br /></>}
      {HAS_PHONE && <><a href={SITE.phoneHref}>{SITE.phone}</a><br /></>}
      {!HAS_EMAIL && !HAS_PHONE && <a href="/contact/">Contact us</a>}</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
